            "title": "What credit cards do you accept?",
            "content": "<p>We accept American Express, Visa, Mastercard, and Discover. We also accept PayPal when applicable. If you have a preferred method of payment that we don’t offer, please email so that we can look into it. You can write us <a href=\"https://summerfridays.com/help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://summerfridays.com/help\">here</a> – we’re always looking to expand our offering. Please note we do not accept gift cards, banking gift cards, international credit cards, checks or money orders.</p>"
