            "content": "<p>Standard shipping is USPS and/or UPS Mail Innovations (the package will ship via UPS and be delivered by your local USPS). Your order will arrive approximately 7-10 business days from date of purchase (Hawaii, Alaska, Puerto Rico & US Virgin Islands may experience longer transit times). Summer Fridays does not ship to freight forwarding companies or export agents. <br/><br/>Expedited shipping options are also available for an additional fee. These options are listed at check out. Please note that expedited shipping options are available for Monday through Friday delivery, excluding holidays.<br/><br/>Please note: orders over $350 will require signature at delivery</p>"
